        temporary ghost that fades on its own once the static image is gone, often within minutes, and it happens on LCD panels too. Burn-in
        does not fade. Checking a suspected ghost again after twenty minutes of varied content is the simplest way to tell them apart.
      </p>

      <h2>How to Check for Existing Burn-In</h2>
