        to wash faint discoloration out and pure black gives it nothing to show against, but an even mid-tone sits exactly where a worn
        patch separates from an unworn one. Step through 20%, 50%, and 75% grey and give each a few seconds.
      </p>
      <h3>Work in a dim room at a steady brightness</h3>
